<title>EGYPT: TENNIS-PORTUGAL BEAT EGYPT 3-0 IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-PORTUGAL BEAT EGYPT 3-0 IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal took an unbeatable 3-0 lead against Egypt after their doubles match in their Davis Cup Euro/African zone group two tie on Saturday.</p>
<p>Result (Portuguese names first)</p>
<p>Emanuel Couto and Joe Acunha beat Adli Shafei and Amr Ghuneim 7-5 6-1 6-0</p>
